        Visual details:
        1. The skyline is lit up by hundreds of neon lights scattered across the landscape, creating a surreal and otherworldly ambiance.
        2. The buildings themselves are made of sleek, metallic materials with sharp angles and angular shapes. This creates a sense of futuristic modernity while also hinting at their utilitarian origins.
