2025-05-02 11:37:45,696 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '3d8dd9ca-cde1-4b07-8cdf-aa60e9367421', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:12:52', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hovering vehicles', 'enhanced_prompt': '- The sky is a deep blue hue with thick clouds moving across it.\n        - The city is lit by a warm orange glow that illuminates the streets and buildings.\n        - In the distance, tall skyscrapers stand proudly as if watching over the cityscape.\n        - Hovering aircraft can be seen flying above the city, their wings splayed out like jewelry.\n        - The ground is bathed in soft golden light from streetlamps and neon signs.\n        - The people walking around are dressed in futuristic clothing, with some wearing exoskeletons and others sporting energy armor.\n        - The atmosphere is tense and excited, with a sense of anticipation and excitement for what lies ahead.\n        - The style is sleek and modern, with a touch of retro design elements like old school video games or classic science fiction movies.\n        - Perspective: The city has been designed to appear three-dimensional, with walls and buildings protruding off the surface like a living sculpture.', 'image_path': 'output/images/3667de50-ecb4-475e-bdf5-d48ccb9ef004.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/e5cd1f67-f755-4abd-bd99-040a2034bb86.glb'}
2025-05-02 11:37:45,733 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '34beb779-77fd-44ae-8f55-60095977fcd9', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:17:01', 'original_prompt': 'A serene beach with crystal-clear water and palm trees at sunrise', 'enhanced_prompt': "Lighting: Sun shining bright through a canopy of leaves above the lush green landscape, casting reflections on the sparkling waves below. The sky is a deep shade of blue, hinting at the imminent arrival of clouds. The sea breeze rustles through the tall grasses surrounding the shore.\n        \n        Atmosphere: The gentle hum of chirping birds fills the air as they perch on branches high up in the tree line. Bees buzz around, creating patterns on the blooming flowers. A faint smell of salt and ocean spray envelops your senses.\n        \n        Style: This is a portrait session, capturing the beauty of a woman's face under soft lighting. Her long curls frame her features, while the texture of her skin and clothing create depth and movement. The light cast by the golden sunbeams filters through her eyes, highlighting their irises and giving them an ethereal quality.\n        \n        Perspective: From this vantage point, you see everything from a bird’s eye view. The beach stretches out before you like a vast expanse of sand, the palms reaching towards the horizon. The water reflects the sky like a mirror, creating an endless vista of turquoise and silver.", 'image_path': 'output/images/65de3dd7-5045-45d7-9c0a-9212c5831596.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/c7216283-90e9-440f-88e3-e7253aaf8b38.glb'}
2025-05-02 11:37:45,761 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm', 'enhanced_prompt': "- The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb'}
2025-05-02 11:37:45,794 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '92598102-74e3-40bb-b2ec-cb328b0ccdaf', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:11:46', 'original_prompt': 'A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun slowly descends towards the horizon, a neon-lit skyline basks in the golden rays. The city's skyscrapers stretch high into the clouds, their windows ablaze with colorful lights that dance across the night sky. \n        \n        In the distance, sleek black taxis glide through the air, their engines roaring as they take passengers on a ride around the city's edges. Buttons on their door handles flash with incoming calls and notifications, while small touches like the tinkling sound of champagne glasses or the humming of a jazz band blend seamlessly into the ambient soundscape.\n        \n        The street below is alive with life, dancers twirling along the pavement, laughter echoing from nearby bars and restaurants. The smell of freshly brewed coffee wafts from an open-air cafe on one corner, while the scent of burning rubber fills the air from the hustle and bustle of cars speeding by.\n        \n        In the distance, the silhouette of a futuristic metropolis emerges from the hazy fog. Towering structures rise up out of the mist like massive spacecraft, their surfaces adorned with intricate patterns and symbols that glow in the dim light. \n        \n        The air is thick with a sense of excitement and possibility – a reminder that anything could happen in this world.", 'image_path': 'output/images/727107ca-9ab2-4894-97e2-1620c03cd818.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/109463c9-582f-4399-8a86-9994e1620b34.glb'}
