2025-05-02 11:47:41,499 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'score': 0.7373306155204773, 'content': "An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm - The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm'}
