2025-05-02 11:47:41,565 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '34beb779-77fd-44ae-8f55-60095977fcd9', 'score': 1.6877858638763428, 'content': "A serene beach with crystal-clear water and palm trees at sunrise Lighting: Sun shining bright through a canopy of leaves above the lush green landscape, casting reflections on the sparkling waves below. The sky is a deep shade of blue, hinting at the imminent arrival of clouds. The sea breeze rustles through the tall grasses surrounding the shore.\n        \n        Atmosphere: The gentle hum of chirping birds fills the air as they perch on branches high up in the tree line. Bees buzz around, creating patterns on the blooming flowers. A faint smell of salt and ocean spray envelops your senses.\n        \n        Style: This is a portrait session, capturing the beauty of a woman's face under soft lighting. Her long curls frame her features, while the texture of her skin and clothing create depth and movement. The light cast by the golden sunbeams filters through her eyes, highlighting their irises and giving them an ethereal quality.\n        \n        Perspective: From this vantage point, you see everything from a bird’s eye view. The beach stretches out before you like a vast expanse of sand, the palms reaching towards the horizon. The water reflects the sky like a mirror, creating an endless vista of turquoise and silver.", 'image_path': 'output/images/65de3dd7-5045-45d7-9c0a-9212c5831596.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/c7216283-90e9-440f-88e3-e7253aaf8b38.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:17:01', 'original_prompt': 'A serene beach with crystal-clear water and palm trees at sunrise'}
2025-05-02 11:47:41,594 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '92598102-74e3-40bb-b2ec-cb328b0ccdaf', 'score': 1.7432173490524292, 'content': "A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars As the sun slowly descends towards the horizon, a neon-lit skyline basks in the golden rays. The city's skyscrapers stretch high into the clouds, their windows ablaze with colorful lights that dance across the night sky. \n        \n        In the distance, sleek black taxis glide through the air, their engines roaring as they take passengers on a ride around the city's edges. Buttons on their door handles flash with incoming calls and notifications, while small touches like the tinkling sound of champagne glasses or the humming of a jazz band blend seamlessly into the ambient soundscape.\n        \n        The street below is alive with life, dancers twirling along the pavement, laughter echoing from nearby bars and restaurants. The smell of freshly brewed coffee wafts from an open-air cafe on one corner, while the scent of burning rubber fills the air from the hustle and bustle of cars speeding by.\n        \n        In the distance, the silhouette of a futuristic metropolis emerges from the hazy fog. Towering structures rise up out of the mist like massive spacecraft, their surfaces adorned with intricate patterns and symbols that glow in the dim light. \n        \n        The air is thick with a sense of excitement and possibility – a reminder that anything could happen in this world.", 'image_path': 'output/images/727107ca-9ab2-4894-97e2-1620c03cd818.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/109463c9-582f-4399-8a86-9994e1620b34.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:11:46', 'original_prompt': 'A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars'}
