2025-05-02 12:35:31,143 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '4f3d74b1-d8d3-4f8a-8ea6-c12bf2940aa8', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:10:38', 'original_prompt': 'add flying cars on it (Similar to my previous creation: An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm - The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind pi)', 'enhanced_prompt': "Imagine you are standing atop a mountain, with an enchanting landscape stretching before you like a dream. As your eyes adjust to the darkness, you see that above the clouds you can spot a fleet of gleaming white cars zooming down below. Their sleek aerodynamic design shimmering against the darkening sky, their creamy white hulls catching the first flicker of light.\n            \n            The air around you is alive with movement, the wind rustling through the trees and over the peaks. The mountainside is shrouded in mist, casting eerie shadows across the valley floor. Yet even amidst this otherworldly scene, there is something familiar and comforting, a sense of peacefulness that draws you closer to the rushing river far below.\n            \n            Into this mystical world steps a young woman, her hair wrapped tightly in a scarf as she walks through the mist. She's clutching a bouquet of flowers, which sway gently in the breeze, adding a touch of earthiness to the otherwise ethereal surroundings. Her eyes flicker up to meet yours, then away again, revealing a warmth and intelligence that draws you deeper into the moment.\n            \n            As you continue along the path, you come upon a small village nestled among the hillsides. Houses made from stone and wood, with thatched roofs and sturdy wooden doors, seem almost ancient by contrast with the modern machines passing beneath your feet. You stop to watch as a group of children run and play, laughing and shouting without care or fear. It's hard not to feel caught up in their energy and joy.\n            \n            Suddenly, the lights of the city spill out from the town square, illuminating the streets and alleys like the dawn breaking over the horizon. This new vista is a stark contrast to the calming natural world you've just witnessed, yet it also feels somehow more vibrant and alive.\n            \n            As night falls, a lone figure emerges from the shadows, riding on top of one of those sleek white cars. Your heart leaps with excitement as you watch them disappear into the distance, leaving only the soft rustle of leaves behind. You wonder if they are part of some larger plan, if they belong to someone or something", 'image_path': 'output/images/8916f4d0-fb15-480f-a15e-c0c159948887.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/ba1669f7-6d3c-413f-8a56-611a1c3749bf.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:35:31,170 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '0d749741-c902-4ddf-b810-f08ab3b9dad4', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:32:55', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "A dark and mysterious space station looms above the cityscape in a twilit sky, illuminated by a shimmering orb of energy. The towering structure's facade is made up of intricate geometrical patterns etched into metal panels, their angles sharp and precise as if carved out by advanced alien technology.\n\nThe air around the station is thick with a smoky haze, obscuring any view beyond the horizon. The streetlights flicker on and off, casting eerie shadows on the pavement below. As you move closer, you notice the faint scent of decay wafting from within.\n\nBeneath the station's dome, hidden away behind layers of glass and steel, lies a sprawling underground complex filled with gleaming storage tanks, humming machinery, and stunningly intricate display screens displaying data and images of the stars. It's a hub of activity, teeming with people of all shapes and sizes - some dressed in sleek black suits, others wearing futuristic costumes with exotic designs.\n\nAs you scan the crowd, you see the subtle shift in their expressions as they look over your shoulder towards the station. You hear whispers echoing through the streets as the residents of this bustling metropolis become aware of your presence.\n\nInside the station, you marvel at its sheer scale and complexity. Its interior walls are adorned with murals painted by artists from all corners of the galaxy, depicting lifeforms and cultures unknown to Earth. A massive rotating platform circles the station's center, providing a breathtaking view of the night sky and the distant galaxies.\n\nDespite the gravity and danger of what you do here, you find yourself drawn to it – perhaps because it represents humanity's ability to push boundaries, explore new frontiers, and unlock infinite possibilities. But as time goes on, you begin to question the true meaning of this place, wondering whether it really exists or if it's just another fantastical construct created solely for entertainment.\n\nFinally, you step back outside, gazing up at the towering structures that once stood tall and proud, now nothing but dust and ruins. And though you can never truly leave the city behind, knowing that somewhere else in the universe there might be something even greater", 'image_path': 'output/images/2e58d219-ebf1-4ba8-a061-ee6bca55c2ad.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/670ca32b-59e9-4763-9d25-ac9258a1a66b.glb'}
