2025-05-02 12:40:27,075 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '0d749741-c902-4ddf-b810-f08ab3b9dad4', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:32:55', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "A dark and mysterious space station looms above the cityscape in a twilit sky, illuminated by a shimmering orb of energy. The towering structure's facade is made up of intricate geometrical patterns etched into metal panels, their angles sharp and precise as if carved out by advanced alien technology.\n\nThe air around the station is thick with a smoky haze, obscuring any view beyond the horizon. The streetlights flicker on and off, casting eerie shadows on the pavement below. As you move closer, you notice the faint scent of decay wafting from within.\n\nBeneath the station's dome, hidden away behind layers of glass and steel, lies a sprawling underground complex filled with gleaming storage tanks, humming machinery, and stunningly intricate display screens displaying data and images of the stars. It's a hub of activity, teeming with people of all shapes and sizes - some dressed in sleek black suits, others wearing futuristic costumes with exotic designs.\n\nAs you scan the crowd, you see the subtle shift in their expressions as they look over your shoulder towards the station. You hear whispers echoing through the streets as the residents of this bustling metropolis become aware of your presence.\n\nInside the station, you marvel at its sheer scale and complexity. Its interior walls are adorned with murals painted by artists from all corners of the galaxy, depicting lifeforms and cultures unknown to Earth. A massive rotating platform circles the station's center, providing a breathtaking view of the night sky and the distant galaxies.\n\nDespite the gravity and danger of what you do here, you find yourself drawn to it – perhaps because it represents humanity's ability to push boundaries, explore new frontiers, and unlock infinite possibilities. But as time goes on, you begin to question the true meaning of this place, wondering whether it really exists or if it's just another fantastical construct created solely for entertainment.\n\nFinally, you step back outside, gazing up at the towering structures that once stood tall and proud, now nothing but dust and ruins. And though you can never truly leave the city behind, knowing that somewhere else in the universe there might be something even greater", 'image_path': 'output/images/2e58d219-ebf1-4ba8-a061-ee6bca55c2ad.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/670ca32b-59e9-4763-9d25-ac9258a1a66b.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,107 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'd1193eaf-dd84-4100-a3f7-02d88cbb3880', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:35:30', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "In this image, the sky above is painted in a warm hue of pink and orange, creating a sense of nostalgia and romance. The streets below are illuminated by a soft golden light, casting a diffused light on the buildings and cars. The air around you feels crisp and fresh, as if it's just emerged from a nearby forest or garden. You can see people walking home from work, dressed in their finest garments, walking alongside each other, and some even stop to chat. The city's architecture seems to be made up of sleek, modern skyscrapers set against a backdrop of towering trees that stretch as far as the eye can see. This scene is a perfect representation of the dreamy, idyllic world depicted in science fiction stories, where humans have achieved great heights of technological advancement while still preserving their humanity and beauty. It's a world where the lines between what is real and unreal blur, and where time and space are nothing but fleeting concepts that exist only in our minds.", 'image_path': 'output/images/d71155ea-d0dc-4fbd-b6a6-57d5e3724e98.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/7ee09377-37d7-49cc-ba5b-e9175e7e7389.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,141 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '3d8dd9ca-cde1-4b07-8cdf-aa60e9367421', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:12:52', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hovering vehicles', 'enhanced_prompt': '- The sky is a deep blue hue with thick clouds moving across it.\n        - The city is lit by a warm orange glow that illuminates the streets and buildings.\n        - In the distance, tall skyscrapers stand proudly as if watching over the cityscape.\n        - Hovering aircraft can be seen flying above the city, their wings splayed out like jewelry.\n        - The ground is bathed in soft golden light from streetlamps and neon signs.\n        - The people walking around are dressed in futuristic clothing, with some wearing exoskeletons and others sporting energy armor.\n        - The atmosphere is tense and excited, with a sense of anticipation and excitement for what lies ahead.\n        - The style is sleek and modern, with a touch of retro design elements like old school video games or classic science fiction movies.\n        - Perspective: The city has been designed to appear three-dimensional, with walls and buildings protruding off the surface like a living sculpture.', 'image_path': 'output/images/3667de50-ecb4-475e-bdf5-d48ccb9ef004.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/e5cd1f67-f755-4abd-bd99-040a2034bb86.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,177 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '34beb779-77fd-44ae-8f55-60095977fcd9', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:17:01', 'original_prompt': 'A serene beach with crystal-clear water and palm trees at sunrise', 'enhanced_prompt': "Lighting: Sun shining bright through a canopy of leaves above the lush green landscape, casting reflections on the sparkling waves below. The sky is a deep shade of blue, hinting at the imminent arrival of clouds. The sea breeze rustles through the tall grasses surrounding the shore.\n        \n        Atmosphere: The gentle hum of chirping birds fills the air as they perch on branches high up in the tree line. Bees buzz around, creating patterns on the blooming flowers. A faint smell of salt and ocean spray envelops your senses.\n        \n        Style: This is a portrait session, capturing the beauty of a woman's face under soft lighting. Her long curls frame her features, while the texture of her skin and clothing create depth and movement. The light cast by the golden sunbeams filters through her eyes, highlighting their irises and giving them an ethereal quality.\n        \n        Perspective: From this vantage point, you see everything from a bird’s eye view. The beach stretches out before you like a vast expanse of sand, the palms reaching towards the horizon. The water reflects the sky like a mirror, creating an endless vista of turquoise and silver.", 'image_path': 'output/images/65de3dd7-5045-45d7-9c0a-9212c5831596.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/c7216283-90e9-440f-88e3-e7253aaf8b38.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,210 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm', 'enhanced_prompt': "- The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,249 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '92598102-74e3-40bb-b2ec-cb328b0ccdaf', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:11:46', 'original_prompt': 'A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun slowly descends towards the horizon, a neon-lit skyline basks in the golden rays. The city's skyscrapers stretch high into the clouds, their windows ablaze with colorful lights that dance across the night sky. \n        \n        In the distance, sleek black taxis glide through the air, their engines roaring as they take passengers on a ride around the city's edges. Buttons on their door handles flash with incoming calls and notifications, while small touches like the tinkling sound of champagne glasses or the humming of a jazz band blend seamlessly into the ambient soundscape.\n        \n        The street below is alive with life, dancers twirling along the pavement, laughter echoing from nearby bars and restaurants. The smell of freshly brewed coffee wafts from an open-air cafe on one corner, while the scent of burning rubber fills the air from the hustle and bustle of cars speeding by.\n        \n        In the distance, the silhouette of a futuristic metropolis emerges from the hazy fog. Towering structures rise up out of the mist like massive spacecraft, their surfaces adorned with intricate patterns and symbols that glow in the dim light. \n        \n        The air is thick with a sense of excitement and possibility – a reminder that anything could happen in this world.", 'image_path': 'output/images/727107ca-9ab2-4894-97e2-1620c03cd818.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/109463c9-582f-4399-8a86-9994e1620b34.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:40:27,286 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '4f3d74b1-d8d3-4f8a-8ea6-c12bf2940aa8', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:10:38', 'original_prompt': 'add flying cars on it (Similar to my previous creation: An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm - The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind pi)', 'enhanced_prompt': "Imagine you are standing atop a mountain, with an enchanting landscape stretching before you like a dream. As your eyes adjust to the darkness, you see that above the clouds you can spot a fleet of gleaming white cars zooming down below. Their sleek aerodynamic design shimmering against the darkening sky, their creamy white hulls catching the first flicker of light.\n            \n            The air around you is alive with movement, the wind rustling through the trees and over the peaks. The mountainside is shrouded in mist, casting eerie shadows across the valley floor. Yet even amidst this otherworldly scene, there is something familiar and comforting, a sense of peacefulness that draws you closer to the rushing river far below.\n            \n            Into this mystical world steps a young woman, her hair wrapped tightly in a scarf as she walks through the mist. She's clutching a bouquet of flowers, which sway gently in the breeze, adding a touch of earthiness to the otherwise ethereal surroundings. Her eyes flicker up to meet yours, then away again, revealing a warmth and intelligence that draws you deeper into the moment.\n            \n            As you continue along the path, you come upon a small village nestled among the hillsides. Houses made from stone and wood, with thatched roofs and sturdy wooden doors, seem almost ancient by contrast with the modern machines passing beneath your feet. You stop to watch as a group of children run and play, laughing and shouting without care or fear. It's hard not to feel caught up in their energy and joy.\n            \n            Suddenly, the lights of the city spill out from the town square, illuminating the streets and alleys like the dawn breaking over the horizon. This new vista is a stark contrast to the calming natural world you've just witnessed, yet it also feels somehow more vibrant and alive.\n            \n            As night falls, a lone figure emerges from the shadows, riding on top of one of those sleek white cars. Your heart leaps with excitement as you watch them disappear into the distance, leaving only the soft rustle of leaves behind. You wonder if they are part of some larger plan, if they belong to someone or something", 'image_path': 'output/images/8916f4d0-fb15-480f-a15e-c0c159948887.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/ba1669f7-6d3c-413f-8a56-611a1c3749bf.glb'}
