chine again, this time asking, "show me a picture of a building that\'s been destroyed by fire." Again, they receive a static animation, but this time it\'s much clearer. A towering structure looms in the distance, with flames shooting out from both sides. The protagonist can see smoke billowing in the air, casting eerie shadows onto the ground below.\n\nIntrigu', 'image_path': 'output/images/4d54e04c-3e88-4b32-b5e7-6bba1834f5ef.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/0c42faa5-34e8-4f1f-b8d3-a951aef5f35b.glb'}
