2025-05-02 12:59:31,330 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'd1193eaf-dd84-4100-a3f7-02d88cbb3880', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:35:30', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "In this image, the sky above is painted in a warm hue of pink and orange, creating a sense of nostalgia and romance. The streets below are illuminated by a soft golden light, casting a diffused light on the buildings and cars. The air around you feels crisp and fresh, as if it's just emerged from a nearby forest or garden. You can see people walking home from work, dressed in their finest garments, walking alongside each other, and some even stop to chat. The city's architecture seems to be made up of sleek, modern skyscrapers set against a backdrop of towering trees that stretch as far as the eye can see. This scene is a perfect representation of the dreamy, idyllic world depicted in science fiction stories, where humans have achieved great heights of technological advancement while still preserving their humanity and beauty. It's a world where the lines between what is real and unreal blur, and where time and space are nothing but fleeting concepts that exist only in our minds.", 'image_path': 'output/images/d71155ea-d0dc-4fbd-b6a6-57d5e3724e98.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/7ee09377-37d7-49cc-ba5b-e9175e7e7389.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,362 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '3d8dd9ca-cde1-4b07-8cdf-aa60e9367421', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:12:52', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hovering vehicles', 'enhanced_prompt': '- The sky is a deep blue hue with thick clouds moving across it.\n        - The city is lit by a warm orange glow that illuminates the streets and buildings.\n        - In the distance, tall skyscrapers stand proudly as if watching over the cityscape.\n        - Hovering aircraft can be seen flying above the city, their wings splayed out like jewelry.\n        - The ground is bathed in soft golden light from streetlamps and neon signs.\n        - The people walking around are dressed in futuristic clothing, with some wearing exoskeletons and others sporting energy armor.\n        - The atmosphere is tense and excited, with a sense of anticipation and excitement for what lies ahead.\n        - The style is sleek and modern, with a touch of retro design elements like old school video games or classic science fiction movies.\n        - Perspective: The city has been designed to appear three-dimensional, with walls and buildings protruding off the surface like a living sculpture.', 'image_path': 'output/images/3667de50-ecb4-475e-bdf5-d48ccb9ef004.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/e5cd1f67-f755-4abd-bd99-040a2034bb86.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,396 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '34beb779-77fd-44ae-8f55-60095977fcd9', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:17:01', 'original_prompt': 'A serene beach with crystal-clear water and palm trees at sunrise', 'enhanced_prompt': "Lighting: Sun shining bright through a canopy of leaves above the lush green landscape, casting reflections on the sparkling waves below. The sky is a deep shade of blue, hinting at the imminent arrival of clouds. The sea breeze rustles through the tall grasses surrounding the shore.\n        \n        Atmosphere: The gentle hum of chirping birds fills the air as they perch on branches high up in the tree line. Bees buzz around, creating patterns on the blooming flowers. A faint smell of salt and ocean spray envelops your senses.\n        \n        Style: This is a portrait session, capturing the beauty of a woman's face under soft lighting. Her long curls frame her features, while the texture of her skin and clothing create depth and movement. The light cast by the golden sunbeams filters through her eyes, highlighting their irises and giving them an ethereal quality.\n        \n        Perspective: From this vantage point, you see everything from a bird’s eye view. The beach stretches out before you like a vast expanse of sand, the palms reaching towards the horizon. The water reflects the sky like a mirror, creating an endless vista of turquoise and silver.", 'image_path': 'output/images/65de3dd7-5045-45d7-9c0a-9212c5831596.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/c7216283-90e9-440f-88e3-e7253aaf8b38.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,427 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm', 'enhanced_prompt': "- The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,458 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '92598102-74e3-40bb-b2ec-cb328b0ccdaf', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:11:46', 'original_prompt': 'A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun slowly descends towards the horizon, a neon-lit skyline basks in the golden rays. The city's skyscrapers stretch high into the clouds, their windows ablaze with colorful lights that dance across the night sky. \n        \n        In the distance, sleek black taxis glide through the air, their engines roaring as they take passengers on a ride around the city's edges. Buttons on their door handles flash with incoming calls and notifications, while small touches like the tinkling sound of champagne glasses or the humming of a jazz band blend seamlessly into the ambient soundscape.\n        \n        The street below is alive with life, dancers twirling along the pavement, laughter echoing from nearby bars and restaurants. The smell of freshly brewed coffee wafts from an open-air cafe on one corner, while the scent of burning rubber fills the air from the hustle and bustle of cars speeding by.\n        \n        In the distance, the silhouette of a futuristic metropolis emerges from the hazy fog. Towering structures rise up out of the mist like massive spacecraft, their surfaces adorned with intricate patterns and symbols that glow in the dim light. \n        \n        The air is thick with a sense of excitement and possibility – a reminder that anything could happen in this world.", 'image_path': 'output/images/727107ca-9ab2-4894-97e2-1620c03cd818.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/109463c9-582f-4399-8a86-9994e1620b34.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,494 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '4f3d74b1-d8d3-4f8a-8ea6-c12bf2940aa8', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:10:38', 'original_prompt': 'add flying cars on it (Similar to my previous creation: An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm - The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind pi)', 'enhanced_prompt': "Imagine you are standing atop a mountain, with an enchanting landscape stretching before you like a dream. As your eyes adjust to the darkness, you see that above the clouds you can spot a fleet of gleaming white cars zooming down below. Their sleek aerodynamic design shimmering against the darkening sky, their creamy white hulls catching the first flicker of light.\n            \n            The air around you is alive with movement, the wind rustling through the trees and over the peaks. The mountainside is shrouded in mist, casting eerie shadows across the valley floor. Yet even amidst this otherworldly scene, there is something familiar and comforting, a sense of peacefulness that draws you closer to the rushing river far below.\n            \n            Into this mystical world steps a young woman, her hair wrapped tightly in a scarf as she walks through the mist. She's clutching a bouquet of flowers, which sway gently in the breeze, adding a touch of earthiness to the otherwise ethereal surroundings. Her eyes flicker up to meet yours, then away again, revealing a warmth and intelligence that draws you deeper into the moment.\n            \n            As you continue along the path, you come upon a small village nestled among the hillsides. Houses made from stone and wood, with thatched roofs and sturdy wooden doors, seem almost ancient by contrast with the modern machines passing beneath your feet. You stop to watch as a group of children run and play, laughing and shouting without care or fear. It's hard not to feel caught up in their energy and joy.\n            \n            Suddenly, the lights of the city spill out from the town square, illuminating the streets and alleys like the dawn breaking over the horizon. This new vista is a stark contrast to the calming natural world you've just witnessed, yet it also feels somehow more vibrant and alive.\n            \n            As night falls, a lone figure emerges from the shadows, riding on top of one of those sleek white cars. Your heart leaps with excitement as you watch them disappear into the distance, leaving only the soft rustle of leaves behind. You wonder if they are part of some larger plan, if they belong to someone or something", 'image_path': 'output/images/8916f4d0-fb15-480f-a15e-c0c159948887.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/ba1669f7-6d3c-413f-8a56-611a1c3749bf.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,529 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '7e980e2d-877a-4867-a7cd-7c87d11043f3', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:42:02', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "The sky above you is aglow with soft hues of pink and purple as if in a dusk setting sun. The city streets twist and turn, creating a labyrinthine maze filled with towering buildings and reflective surfaces that sparkle in the moonlight. Cars and bikes zip past, their neon lights casting eerie shadows on the pavement below.\n\nAs you take in the sights, your eyes scan the rooftops for any unusual architecture or sculptures. You spot a futuristic skyscraper with its facade adorned with intricate patterns made up of thousands of tiny LED lights. Its sleek curves create a mesmerizing effect, almost like it's floating on air.\n\nPassing by a mosaic of gleaming white marbles, you notice a group of people gathered around a fountain. They're playing a game of basketball against a backdrop of waterfalls cascading down from high above. The playful action adds a touch of whimsy to this otherwise stunning scene.\n\nAs you continue walking, you come across a street artist painting a giant canvas with neon colors that dance in the wind. The vibrant colors pop against the dark urban landscape, making everything seem larger than life.\n\nLooking closer, you see a pair of alien hands reaching out towards each other with glistening silver veins. Their delicate fingers curl and uncurl, forming intricate designs that blend into the surrounding architecture. It's like they were created specifically for this place.\n\nAll around you, strange shapes emerge from the darkness. Strange machines hum, sending beams of energy through the city. Flickering laser beams beam from the distant corners of buildings, illuminating the night sky in a kaleidoscope of color.\n\nThrough it all, there's one thing that stands out: the city's pulsing energy. Everywhere you look, there's a sense of movement and motion, as if every surface has been transformed into a living organism. This is the essence of this amazing metropolitan skyline - alive, dynamic, and full of surprises.", 'image_path': 'output/images/9a778c2f-5c40-462c-bb86-0310efc8e634.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/18b934a5-ac3c-4720-9a14-e63b10c8c2cf.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,572 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'c2ea134e-4db7-4187-9733-bfe8befedf60', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:46:53', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': 'As the sun sets over the city, its skyline cast in shades of gold and orange, a lone figure wends their way through the streets. The buildings are sleek and futuristic, their windows illuminated by muted, greenish light. The air is filled with the buzzing hum of tech devices and the distant sound of engines rumbling beneath the pavement. As they reach the outskirts, the streetlights begin to dim, casting eerie shadows across the empty rooftops. Above them, the sky glimmers with a soft pink hue, hinting at the presence of the stars above.\n\nThe protagonist enters a doorway, stepping into a cavernous hallway. It\'s lit only by a few flickering torches, casting eerie shadows on the walls. The space is sparse, with only a single table and several chairs set up against one wall. The air is thick with the scent of stale coffee and musty books.\n\nThe protagonist notices a small device on a nearby table - a projector, glowing with an eerie red light. They approach it tentatively, unsure if they should disturb the device\'s current activity. But as they get closer, they notice something odd about the projection. Instead of showing images of the city or anything else in particular, there\'s a static animation playing in front of the screen: a man walking down a deserted street.\n\nWithout thinking, the protagonist begins typing in commands, "show me a picture of a person walking down a deserted street." After what seems like hours, a photo appears on the projector. It shows a young woman, her face blurry and expressionless, standing alone in the middle of a desolate alleyway. The scene is shot from a low angle, giving the impression of being obscured by dust or smoke.\n\nOverwhelmed by the new information, the protagonist approaches the machine again, this time asking, "show me a picture of a building that\'s been destroyed by fire." Again, they receive a static animation, but this time it\'s much clearer. A towering structure looms in the distance, with flames shooting out from both sides. The protagonist can see smoke billowing in the air, casting eerie shadows onto the ground below.\n\nIntrigu', 'image_path': 'output/images/4d54e04c-3e88-4b32-b5e7-6bba1834f5ef.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/0c42faa5-34e8-4f1f-b8d3-a951aef5f35b.glb'}
2025-05-02 12:59:31,610 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '07202b14-4121-46d0-b4af-354bc1479b9c', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:59:31', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "The sky above a futuristic city at night is bathed in soft, warm hues of pink and orange as the sun sets behind the imposing structures. The air is thick with the humidity of liquid metal, melded together in a symphony of lights and shapes. The streets are lined with sleek, silver vehicles that glide silently through the twisted alleys, casting dappled shadows on their surfaces.\n\nIn the distance, the towering spires of a skyscraper rise up against the darkening horizon, their sharp angles reflecting off the glass façade. The looming structure seems almost alive, its surface rippling with energy and life. Far below, the glimmering beacon of the metropolitan area illuminates the darkness like a luminescent beacon, its neon colors blending seamlessly into the ever-changing landscape.\n\nAs the light gradually fades, the sky transforms into a deep, black void, blanketed by a hazy mist that fills every crevice and contours of the scene. The once-brilliant city now appears like a distant memory, replaced by a wasteland of smoky ruins and debris. This is the aftermath of a catastrophic event, one that has left nothing but devastation in its wake.\n\nBut despite this bleakness, there are still pockets of beauty and hope. The hovering structures still stand tall, their glowing edges and interconnected patterns seemingly defying gravity itself. The city's inhabitants still exist within these walls, seeking solace and refuge from the destruction around them. Here, in this dimly lit, haunting setting, the artificial intelligence's ability to generate images becomes truly powerful indeed.", 'image_path': 'output/images/c865ca31-87ad-437e-aad4-4f2ebd65ba1a.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/a82e2288-9c8c-46d6-b922-55c5ac3e8b54.glb'}
