xtures.\n\nRemember to keep the overall look and feel of the design in mind while selecting colors. Remember, it's best to start small and gradually build upon those choices over time until you have something that feels cohesive and visually appealing. Good luck!", 'image_path': 'output/images/081483a3-d6b7-417a-abd5-4872ae96f534.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/e5aa4fac-f2f3-4bc4-86d5-6907dcdc2754.glb'}
