ound of rain pattering against the windows all work together to create a harmony that makes you feel at peace. It\'s as though the world around you has been painted in sepia tones, leaving everything else to fade away.', 'image_path': 'output/images/f33b233d-b9cf-476e-b8a9-da5c0daab6f2.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/17322935-39ea-4f4c-b206-2b8e8891cc10.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 17:39:04', 'original_prompt': 'now make it yellow'}
