2025-05-02 18:01:49,666 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '08a32ae4-3f23-413c-809c-277b0cdae3fc', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 17:50:26', 'original_prompt': 'now make it green', 'enhanced_prompt': "As a helpful assistant that enhances image generation prompts with rich visual details, I'm thrilled to offer you this updated version:\n\nIncorporating green into your creative prompts will not only elevate their appearance but also provide them with additional depth and realism. Here are some tips on how to add green to your image-generation prompts:\n\n1. Choose green as the main color: Use green as the primary or dominant color in your images. You could use a shade of green that complements natural foliage, such as olive greens, emerald greens, or lush forest greens. Alternatively, you can choose a brighter hue like fuchsia pink, teal blue, or bright green.\n\n2. Add green around objects: Pay attention to the environment around the object in your prompt. If there's a tree nearby, consider including leaves and branches in the shot. If there's water, include seagulls, fish, or other marine life.\n\n3. Use green as a background color: As a general rule, use green as a background color for your images. This helps create the impression of depth and space. However, if you want to highlight an object within the frame, consider using different colors. For example, you might incorporate a green leafy branch to draw focus to an important element, like a flower blooming next to it.\n\n4. Consider green light sources: When lighting up an image, try to add shades of green to the surrounding light source. This makes the area appear darker, helping to establish contrast and depth. Additionally, consider incorporating soft, diffused lighting. These techniques help to create a warm and inviting atmosphere that promotes relaxation and wellness.\n\n5. Experiment with green tones: While green is always an excellent choice when creating visually appealing images, don't be afraid to experiment with other green tones. Try incorporating emerald greens, verdant blues, or deep lush greens. These colors not only add depth to your images but also give them a sense of groundedness and stability.\n\nRemember, adding green to your image-generation prompts doesn't have to be complicated. By focusing on simple yet effective choices, you'll unlock new levels of visual beauty and make your content stand out to potential customers.", 'image_path': 'output/images/19369e03-0b5c-422d-b48f-8299de1e3440.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/1a2da889-0509-4b0a-ab83-6318a0ac6bda.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,703 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '7e980e2d-877a-4867-a7cd-7c87d11043f3', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:42:02', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "The sky above you is aglow with soft hues of pink and purple as if in a dusk setting sun. The city streets twist and turn, creating a labyrinthine maze filled with towering buildings and reflective surfaces that sparkle in the moonlight. Cars and bikes zip past, their neon lights casting eerie shadows on the pavement below.\n\nAs you take in the sights, your eyes scan the rooftops for any unusual architecture or sculptures. You spot a futuristic skyscraper with its facade adorned with intricate patterns made up of thousands of tiny LED lights. Its sleek curves create a mesmerizing effect, almost like it's floating on air.\n\nPassing by a mosaic of gleaming white marbles, you notice a group of people gathered around a fountain. They're playing a game of basketball against a backdrop of waterfalls cascading down from high above. The playful action adds a touch of whimsy to this otherwise stunning scene.\n\nAs you continue walking, you come across a street artist painting a giant canvas with neon colors that dance in the wind. The vibrant colors pop against the dark urban landscape, making everything seem larger than life.\n\nLooking closer, you see a pair of alien hands reaching out towards each other with glistening silver veins. Their delicate fingers curl and uncurl, forming intricate designs that blend into the surrounding architecture. It's like they were created specifically for this place.\n\nAll around you, strange shapes emerge from the darkness. Strange machines hum, sending beams of energy through the city. Flickering laser beams beam from the distant corners of buildings, illuminating the night sky in a kaleidoscope of color.\n\nThrough it all, there's one thing that stands out: the city's pulsing energy. Everywhere you look, there's a sense of movement and motion, as if every surface has been transformed into a living organism. This is the essence of this amazing metropolitan skyline - alive, dynamic, and full of surprises.", 'image_path': 'output/images/9a778c2f-5c40-462c-bb86-0310efc8e634.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/18b934a5-ac3c-4720-9a14-e63b10c8c2cf.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,738 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm', 'enhanced_prompt': "- The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,771 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'cd910512-7c98-466d-96c1-aeda941a70c5', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 17:19:40', 'original_prompt': 'Generate me a blue car on a road', 'enhanced_prompt': "Sure, here's a Blue Car on a Road Prompt:\n\nImage Generation Prompt: Based on the given text, generate a photo of a blue car parked on a road with its headlights turned on and its license plate visible in the background. The vehicle should be stationary and facing towards the camera. The color scheme is neutral and muted, with the blue hue emphasized through subtle highlights and shadows. Please include a clear view of the front passenger seat, steering wheel, dashboard, and other interior details if possible.", 'image_path': 'output/images/d9d9b4ce-9756-4111-8e54-00ad9c7abc2e.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/d7edc715-b157-41c3-ba27-040f389c0212.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,806 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '92598102-74e3-40bb-b2ec-cb328b0ccdaf', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:11:46', 'original_prompt': 'A neon-lit future city during sunset, full of flying cars', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun slowly descends towards the horizon, a neon-lit skyline basks in the golden rays. The city's skyscrapers stretch high into the clouds, their windows ablaze with colorful lights that dance across the night sky. \n        \n        In the distance, sleek black taxis glide through the air, their engines roaring as they take passengers on a ride around the city's edges. Buttons on their door handles flash with incoming calls and notifications, while small touches like the tinkling sound of champagne glasses or the humming of a jazz band blend seamlessly into the ambient soundscape.\n        \n        The street below is alive with life, dancers twirling along the pavement, laughter echoing from nearby bars and restaurants. The smell of freshly brewed coffee wafts from an open-air cafe on one corner, while the scent of burning rubber fills the air from the hustle and bustle of cars speeding by.\n        \n        In the distance, the silhouette of a futuristic metropolis emerges from the hazy fog. Towering structures rise up out of the mist like massive spacecraft, their surfaces adorned with intricate patterns and symbols that glow in the dim light. \n        \n        The air is thick with a sense of excitement and possibility – a reminder that anything could happen in this world.", 'image_path': 'output/images/727107ca-9ab2-4894-97e2-1620c03cd818.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/109463c9-582f-4399-8a86-9994e1620b34.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,846 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '07202b14-4121-46d0-b4af-354bc1479b9c', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:59:31', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "The sky above a futuristic city at night is bathed in soft, warm hues of pink and orange as the sun sets behind the imposing structures. The air is thick with the humidity of liquid metal, melded together in a symphony of lights and shapes. The streets are lined with sleek, silver vehicles that glide silently through the twisted alleys, casting dappled shadows on their surfaces.\n\nIn the distance, the towering spires of a skyscraper rise up against the darkening horizon, their sharp angles reflecting off the glass façade. The looming structure seems almost alive, its surface rippling with energy and life. Far below, the glimmering beacon of the metropolitan area illuminates the darkness like a luminescent beacon, its neon colors blending seamlessly into the ever-changing landscape.\n\nAs the light gradually fades, the sky transforms into a deep, black void, blanketed by a hazy mist that fills every crevice and contours of the scene. The once-brilliant city now appears like a distant memory, replaced by a wasteland of smoky ruins and debris. This is the aftermath of a catastrophic event, one that has left nothing but devastation in its wake.\n\nBut despite this bleakness, there are still pockets of beauty and hope. The hovering structures still stand tall, their glowing edges and interconnected patterns seemingly defying gravity itself. The city's inhabitants still exist within these walls, seeking solace and refuge from the destruction around them. Here, in this dimly lit, haunting setting, the artificial intelligence's ability to generate images becomes truly powerful indeed.", 'image_path': 'output/images/c865ca31-87ad-437e-aad4-4f2ebd65ba1a.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/a82e2288-9c8c-46d6-b922-55c5ac3e8b54.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:01:49,879 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'c2ea134e-4db7-4187-9733-bfe8befedf60', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:46:53', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': 'As the sun sets over the city, its skyline cast in shades of gold and orange, a lone figure wends their way through the streets. The buildings are sleek and futuristic, their windows illuminated by muted, greenish light. The air is filled with the buzzing hum of tech devices and the distant sound of engines rumbling beneath the pavement. As they reach the outskirts, the streetlights begin to dim, casting eerie shadows across the empty rooftops. Above them, the sky glimmers with a soft pink hue, hinting at the presence of the stars above.\n\nThe protagonist enters a doorway, stepping into a cavernous hallway. It\'s lit only by a few flickering torches, casting eerie shadows on the walls. The space is sparse, with only a single table and several chairs set up against one wall. The air is thick with the scent of stale coffee and musty books.\n\nThe protagonist notices a small device on a nearby table - a projector, glowing with an eerie red light. They approach it tentatively, unsure if they should disturb the device\'s current activity. But as they get closer, they notice something odd about the projection. Instead of showing images of the city or anything else in particular, there\'s a static animation playing in front of the screen: a man walking down a deserted street.\n\nWithout thinking, the protagonist begins typing in commands, "show me a picture of a person walking down a deserted street." After what seems like hours, a photo appears on the projector. It shows a young woman, her face blurry and expressionless, standing alone in the middle of a desolate alleyway. The scene is shot from a low angle, giving the impression of being obscured by dust or smoke.\n\nOverwhelmed by the new information, the protagonist approaches the machine again, this time asking, "show me a picture of a building that\'s been destroyed by fire." Again, they receive a static animation, but this time it\'s much clearer. A towering structure looms in the distance, with flames shooting out from both sides. The protagonist can see smoke billowing in the air, casting eerie shadows onto the ground below.\n\nIntrigu', 'image_path': 'output/images/4d54e04c-3e88-4b32-b5e7-6bba1834f5ef.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/0c42faa5-34e8-4f1f-b8d3-a951aef5f35b.glb'}
