2025-05-02 18:02:51,180 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '7e980e2d-877a-4867-a7cd-7c87d11043f3', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 12:42:02', 'original_prompt': 'A sci-fi metropolis glowing at twilight with hover', 'enhanced_prompt': "The sky above you is aglow with soft hues of pink and purple as if in a dusk setting sun. The city streets twist and turn, creating a labyrinthine maze filled with towering buildings and reflective surfaces that sparkle in the moonlight. Cars and bikes zip past, their neon lights casting eerie shadows on the pavement below.\n\nAs you take in the sights, your eyes scan the rooftops for any unusual architecture or sculptures. You spot a futuristic skyscraper with its facade adorned with intricate patterns made up of thousands of tiny LED lights. Its sleek curves create a mesmerizing effect, almost like it's floating on air.\n\nPassing by a mosaic of gleaming white marbles, you notice a group of people gathered around a fountain. They're playing a game of basketball against a backdrop of waterfalls cascading down from high above. The playful action adds a touch of whimsy to this otherwise stunning scene.\n\nAs you continue walking, you come across a street artist painting a giant canvas with neon colors that dance in the wind. The vibrant colors pop against the dark urban landscape, making everything seem larger than life.\n\nLooking closer, you see a pair of alien hands reaching out towards each other with glistening silver veins. Their delicate fingers curl and uncurl, forming intricate designs that blend into the surrounding architecture. It's like they were created specifically for this place.\n\nAll around you, strange shapes emerge from the darkness. Strange machines hum, sending beams of energy through the city. Flickering laser beams beam from the distant corners of buildings, illuminating the night sky in a kaleidoscope of color.\n\nThrough it all, there's one thing that stands out: the city's pulsing energy. Everywhere you look, there's a sense of movement and motion, as if every surface has been transformed into a living organism. This is the essence of this amazing metropolitan skyline - alive, dynamic, and full of surprises.", 'image_path': 'output/images/9a778c2f-5c40-462c-bb86-0310efc8e634.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/18b934a5-ac3c-4720-9a14-e63b10c8c2cf.glb'}
2025-05-02 18:02:51,217 - __main__ - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '33f6d786-d4a8-481d-a0a6-a680223d1ead', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 11:14:49', 'original_prompt': 'An ancient castle on a mountain during a storm', 'enhanced_prompt': "- The sun is setting behind the castle as the wind picks up, casting long shadows across its exterior walls. The rain gathers around the base of the structure, causing small droplets to cling to the windows and fittings. Lightning illuminates the sky above, creating a dramatic contrast between blue and red hues.\n        \n        - Inside the castle, the air is filled with the sound of thunder and the rhythmic pounding of footsteps. A crackling fire burns in one corner of the room, casting a warm glow over everything. The light from the fire highlights the intricate stonework and ornate carvings on the walls, while the flames cast long, dark shadows over the ceiling and floor.\n        \n        - In the distance, the mountains rise into the night sky, their snowy peaks reflecting the moon's rays. The trees sway in the breeze, their leaves rustling softly against each other like the whispers of distant voices. The sky is painted a deep purple and gold, with occasional flashes of white light dancing along the horizon.\n        \n        - The camera angles themselves are varied, moving quickly through different sections of the castle. The first shot is from above, looking down at the entrance as if it were being watched by some unseen figure. Then we move closer to see the details of the stonework and architecture, before turning back outwards to catch a view of the landscape beyond.", 'image_path': 'output/images/09a5ec99-ff9a-4f0f-a3ad-cc73a13bb695.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/43e3dc1c-b2f2-4fc7-975b-fa3629a41e78.glb'}
