t from the town square, illuminating the streets and alleys like the dawn breaking over the horizon. This new vista is a stark contrast to the calming natural world you've just witnessed, yet it also feels somehow more vibrant and alive.\n            \n            As night falls, a lone figure emerges from the shadows, riding on top of one of those sleek white cars. Your heart leaps with excitement as you watch them disappear into the distance, leaving only the soft rustle of leaves behind. You wonder if they are part of some larger plan, if they belong to someone or something", 'image_path': 'output/images/8916f4d0-fb15-480f-a15e-c0c159948887.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/ba1669f7-6d3c-413f-8a56-611a1c3749bf.glb'}
