 you, calling out a quick explanation before pulling off into the alleyway. "There\'s been an accident down there," he says, pointing towards a small crowd gathered outside the hospital. The officer nods, "Alright, let\'s go. We\'ll talk later." Before leaving, you notice a woman running towards the ambulance, her face covered in', 'image_path': 'output/images/1e0c9d8a-c313-4e7a-bc30-35f7682772a7.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/3934e09d-513b-4f96-9f89-8c71d9036ae2.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 22:33:24', 'original_prompt': 'make a blue car in fine road with police stopping '}
2025-05-02 23:07:28,479 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '50d97256-41b4-4a04-aae9-112dd39e5058', 'score': 1.1344451904296875, 'content': "generate me a blue car speeding in highway with violating red traffic light\n [Suddenly, a blue car speeds down the highway with its headlights illuminated, but it's not obeying the red traffic signal.]\n\nAs the vehicle reaches the intersection, the driver turns on the siren loudly, causing a massive blast of sound that reverberates throughout the surrounding area. The traffic is chaotic as cars swerve left and right, while pedestrians scurry under the overpasses at breakneck speeds.\n\nThe car's sleek exterior reflects the bright sunshine, giving off a cool and contemporary vibe. Its windshield and windows are covered in dark tinted glass, creating a sense of privacy and protection.\n\nBut as the car approaches the stop sign, the driver suddenly brakes hard, sending the vehicle careening into the opposite lane. The sharp impact sends debris flying everywhere, causing a chain reaction of collisions. Pedestrians scatter, some running to safety, others falling victim to the crush of metal and glass.\n\nDespite the chaos around them, the driver remains calm and focused, knowing their mission: to break the law and escape the carnage. They navigate through the wreckage, dodging other cars and avoiding the injured who lie on the ground or cling desperately to nearby trees.\n\nFinally, after what feels like hours, the car comes to a halt, battered and bruised, but still moving forward. As they exit the vehicle, they can see the people behind them, limping away from the scene of destruction, their faces contorted with pain and fear.\n\nWithout hesitation, the driver takes off, leaving the scene of the accident in a blaze of glory. Their flashy ride evokes a sense of danger and excitement, ready to take on any challenge thrown their way.\n\nAnd so, the blue car speeds back onto the highway, oblivious to the havoc it has caused. It's a testament to their skill, strength, and tenacity - proof that sometimes, even when the odds seem stacked against you, you can come out on top.", 'image_path': 'output/images/a36d2228-3e9e-4753-8de1-7bdf09449c2f.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/4cc2c354-cb53-43bf-81d9-b32916c871e3.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-02 22:56:32', 'original_prompt': 'generate me a blue car speeding in highway with violating red traffic light\n'}
2025-05-02 23:07:28,511 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'ae4554f1-0cf2-41ea-a046-0cdd6270c82c', 'score': 1.2789452075958252, 'content': "make it yellow instead [A yellow car rumbles down the highway, heading towards a busy intersection. The driver wears a stylish leather jacket, and his eyes scan the road ahead.]\n\nThe car slows down as it nears the traffic light, then slams on the gas. The yellow car races past the red light, causing a massive explosion of smoke and flames. The shockwave knocks pedestrians and vehicles off their feet.\n\nIn the aftermath, the yellow car is surrounded by a swarm of emergency services personnel. Firefighters race up to the car, trying to put out the fire before it spreads. Ambulance crews rush in to treat the injured.\n\nThe driver looks on in disbelief, unsure if he made the right decision. He tries to call for backup, but there seems to be no cell service. He knows he needs to get out of this mess quickly before things spiral out of control.\n\nSlowly but surely, the driver makes his way towards the nearest emergency room, hoping to save anyone trapped inside. But as he gets closer, he realizes that the hospital is filled to capacity with critically injured victims.\n\nDesperate to help, the driver pulls a small knife from his pocket and stabs his way through the crowded corridors. With each passing moment, he gathers more and more patients, one by one.\n\nAs he works frantically to save lives, he remembers why he started this job in the first place: to protect those in need. To use his skills and abilities to make the world a better place, one patient at a time.\n\nIt's a testament to his courage and determination, his willingness to risk everything just to do good. And though he may never truly know the true cost of his actions, he knows that his legacy will continue to live on long after he's gone.", 'image_path': 'output/images/5e6d2073-d313-4ce3-b7e3-ce9e361ed286.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/330304c2-6fc1-43b9-a