vious to the havoc it has caused. It's a testament to their skill, strength, and tenacity - proof that sometimes, even when the odds seem stacked against you, you can come out on top.", 'image_path': 'output/images/a36d2228-3e9e-4753-8de1-7bdf09449c2f.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/4cc2c354-cb53-43bf-81d9-b32916c871e3.glb'}
