the basketball courts, then looks up at the teenagers and gestures for them to follow him. "Take your seats," he orders, ordering everyone to sit down before continuing. Once seated, he turns back to the players, "Okay, I understand what happened here. But don\'t think that\'s allowed. Anybody else caught breaking these rules will receive a ticket. So, please be careful when you play that way." The te', 'image_path': 'output/images/1b72202a-074b-4fb0-a511-73f8273e0d5a.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/5da27d9e-191b-4faa-b6ba-ea9a3eec7538.glb'}
