2025-05-03 16:40:20,332 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '3616fe72-9bd6-40f1-b816-1f79b98e9f91', 'score': 0.8522111177444458, 'content': "make it red instead As the sun slowly descends below the horizon, a sleek and powerful red sports car speeds down a winding mountain road towards the city. The driver's face is obscured by a scarf or hat as they clutch tightly onto the wheel, eyes fixed firmly ahead. The tires screech as they navigate the twists and turns, creating a symphony of sound unlike any other vehicle on the road. The passengers seated behind them are equally as excited as the driver, eager to witness this rare sight. They watch as the car swoops low over the treetops, its muscular body stretched out before them like a living sculpture. The scenery changes abruptly as the car crosses a narrow riverbed, where the water snakes along the rocky banks, cascading into a series of pools and reflective lakes. The landscape becomes more rugged as the car reaches higher ground, with deep ravines and steep cliffs towering overhead. But amidst all these obstacles lies the beauty of nature, with the red sports car painting a vibrant portrait of the natural world around it. It's a testament to human ingenuity and creativity, a reminder that there's so much more to our universe than what we can see with the naked eye.", 'image_path': 'output/images/a430aad5-084a-4111-ac91-2c6e3b8236b3.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/00e92a4c-9947-4e88-b5ba-d19db3a746d8.glb', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:39:49', 'original_prompt': 'make it red instead'}
