2025-05-03 16:48:59,413 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'a7bc695c-8056-4faf-aa09-88ee1aee401e', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:47:43', 'original_prompt': 'Design a cyberpunk city skyline at night', 'enhanced_prompt': "Here's a design idea for a cyberpunk city skyline at night:\n\n1. The skyline is made up of towering skyscrapers with sleek, angular shapes. The buildings are lit up with neon lights that glow in shades of green, purple, and red. Some of them have futuristic designs, while others look like they were inspired by space travel or sci-fi movies.\n\n2. There are plenty of interconnected bridges and tunnels that connect the different neighborhoods of the city. These structures are covered in LED lights that create a mesmerizing effect as they blend into the surrounding landscape.\n\n3. As you approach some of the buildings from below, you notice their facade transforming into a symphony of colorful lights. Each building has its own unique design, but all of them feature a distinctive pattern of colored lights that seem to dance around each other in a way that feels almost hypnotic.\n\n4. At night, the city streets become alive with a kaleidoscope of colors and movement. Streetlights hang low over the ground, casting long, diagonal shadows across the pavement. The sidewalks are dotted with neon signs that flicker like flames, giving off a warm, inviting glow.\n\n5. Along the edges of the skyline, there are towering billboards that display images of famous celebrities, high-tech gadgets, and futuristic inventions. Their graphics are illuminated in bright, neon hues that create a surrealist effect.\n\n6. Overall, this cyberpunk city skyline stands out with its bold use of light and darkness, intricate detailing, and immersive atmosphere. It creates a world where technology meets beauty, inspiring the imagination and captivating viewers every time they see it.", 'image_path': 'output/images/508e9ac5-1fd5-40de-9806-5f466fb67e43.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/b70aa2e6-ca01-4757-94af-75748480e876.glb'}
