2025-05-03 16:51:28,134 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'a7bc695c-8056-4faf-aa09-88ee1aee401e', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:47:43', 'original_prompt': 'Design a cyberpunk city skyline at night', 'enhanced_prompt': "Here's a design idea for a cyberpunk city skyline at night:\n\n1. The skyline is made up of towering skyscrapers with sleek, angular shapes. The buildings are lit up with neon lights that glow in shades of green, purple, and red. Some of them have futuristic designs, while others look like they were inspired by space travel or sci-fi movies.\n\n2. There are plenty of interconnected bridges and tunnels that connect the different neighborhoods of the city. These structures are covered in LED lights that create a mesmerizing effect as they blend into the surrounding landscape.\n\n3. As you approach some of the buildings from below, you notice their facade transforming into a symphony of colorful lights. Each building has its own unique design, but all of them feature a distinctive pattern of colored lights that seem to dance around each other in a way that feels almost hypnotic.\n\n4. At night, the city streets become alive with a kaleidoscope of colors and movement. Streetlights hang low over the ground, casting long, diagonal shadows across the pavement. The sidewalks are dotted with neon signs that flicker like flames, giving off a warm, inviting glow.\n\n5. Along the edges of the skyline, there are towering billboards that display images of famous celebrities, high-tech gadgets, and futuristic inventions. Their graphics are illuminated in bright, neon hues that create a surrealist effect.\n\n6. Overall, this cyberpunk city skyline stands out with its bold use of light and darkness, intricate detailing, and immersive atmosphere. It creates a world where technology meets beauty, inspiring the imagination and captivating viewers every time they see it.", 'image_path': 'output/images/508e9ac5-1fd5-40de-9806-5f466fb67e43.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/b70aa2e6-ca01-4757-94af-75748480e876.glb'}
2025-05-03 16:51:28,168 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': 'e33b464c-f2c2-46c8-b214-e7fb8b5aaf0b', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:51:00', 'original_prompt': 'make the car green (Similar to my previous creation: A blue car speeding on a highway\n As the sun sets over the vast expanse of the open road, a sleek an)', 'enhanced_prompt': "Sure thing! Here's another design concept using a green car:\n\n1. The skyline is made up of sleek, aerodynamic cars in various shades of green - ranging from mild pastel hues to deep forest greens. They are lined up along the edges of the skyline, reflecting the brilliant colors of the setting sun.\n\n2. Although the cars themselves appear to be moving forward, they are actually stationary, suspended in mid-air. The air currents around them cause the front wheels to spin and bounce in perfect harmony, creating a soothing, serene scene.\n\n3. The vehicles are not merely decorative additions; each one contains advanced technologies and features that could help drivers navigate through unpredictable weather conditions. For example, there may be windshield wipers that adjust to the direction of the wind, reducing visibility in certain directions.\n\n4. The rear doors of these cars offer easy accessibility to passengers, making them ideal for emergency services such as fire trucks or ambulance crews.\n\n5. Despite being designed to be stable and safe, the color green makes the cars stand out even more. The vibrant hue of green seems to glow in the brightness of the sunset, drawing the viewer's eye towards the cars and highlighting their sophistication and cutting-edge capabilities.\n\nOverall, this green cyberpunk city skyline provides a stark contrast to the darkening sky. The smooth curves of the cars, combined with the warmth of the setting sun, create an environment that is both tranquil and exciting.", 'image_path': 'output/images/7b8ae63a-a73a-40b0-a6f9-3c1e10b5cbe5.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/a8f56739-e399-4ba6-a432-e5e3dd38357e.glb'}
2025-05-03 16:51:28,200 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '3616fe72-9bd6-40f1-b816-1f79b98e9f91', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:39:49', 'original_prompt': 'make it red instead', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun slowly descends below the horizon, a sleek and powerful red sports car speeds down a winding mountain road towards the city. The driver's face is obscured by a scarf or hat as they clutch tightly onto the wheel, eyes fixed firmly ahead. The tires screech as they navigate the twists and turns, creating a symphony of sound unlike any other vehicle on the road. The passengers seated behind them are equally as excited as the driver, eager to witness this rare sight. They watch as the car swoops low over the treetops, its muscular body stretched out before them like a living sculpture. The scenery changes abruptly as the car crosses a narrow riverbed, where the water snakes along the rocky banks, cascading into a series of pools and reflective lakes. The landscape becomes more rugged as the car reaches higher ground, with deep ravines and steep cliffs towering overhead. But amidst all these obstacles lies the beauty of nature, with the red sports car painting a vibrant portrait of the natural world around it. It's a testament to human ingenuity and creativity, a reminder that there's so much more to our universe than what we can see with the naked eye.", 'image_path': 'output/images/a430aad5-084a-4111-ac91-2c6e3b8236b3.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/00e92a4c-9947-4e88-b5ba-d19db3a746d8.glb'}
2025-05-03 16:51:28,232 - ui - INFO - Displaying memory: {'id': '450a85e4-4ef4-4839-a7e8-addf8bb1d79d', 'timestamp': '2025-05-03 16:38:26', 'original_prompt': 'A blue car speeding on a highway\n', 'enhanced_prompt': "As the sun sets over the vast expanse of the open road, a sleek and elegant blue sports car speeds past in a flickering display of fiery hues. The driver's face is obscured by sunglasses as they bask in the luxurious glow emanating from their car's engine. The tires squeal as they weave through traffic, creating an eerie but serene soundscape punctuated only by the distant hum of passing cars. The passengers sit back, enjoying the ride with an air of calm confidence, knowing that this is just another part of their life - one that they take for granted daily yet admire in others. As the car nears its destination, the landscape transforms into a lush green valley, dotted with trees and streams, while the horizon ripples with the faint silhouette of distant mountains. The blue car glides effortlessly across the pavement, its lines sharp and precise, enhancing the scene around it in a way that suggests both grandeur and simplicity.", 'image_path': 'output/images/c5c72cac-c172-48fa-936b-77d9a7e0e026.png', 'model_path': 'output/models/e387a2c9-0042-4b93-bd7b-6fc443ee2725.glb'}
